@startuml
!include _style.iuml
actor You
participant "Home Assistant\n(Audio Control)" as HA
participant "Amplifier" as AMP
actor "Someone at\nthe keypad" as K
You -> HA : turn on Kitchen, volume 40 %
HA -> AMP : command
AMP --> HA : confirms
HA --> You : updated
K -> AMP : changes source
AMP --> HA : reports it\n(or the next check, within a minute)
HA --> You : shows the new source
@enduml
